node_modules/
.pi/npm/
# Slate runtime state (worker transcripts, episodes, pending handoff) —
# session data must never be committed.
.pi/slate/
# pi's transient lock on the project settings file — a directory it creates and
# removes around every read of .pi/settings.json. A session (or a verification
# run) that is killed outright can leave one behind, and it must never be
# committed. The glob covers a file as well as a directory.
.pi/*.lock
# IDE state
.idea/
